	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.P.D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Quos nuper dono misisti libellos, vir omnium colendissime, bona fide <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>accepi atque magna delectatione statim perlegi, quo nomine <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>multum me<note type="margin">a.R.: tibi gestrich.</note> tuae pietati deberi merito fateor, qui indies <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>novis muneribus accumulor.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cupio tamen aliquando dari occasionem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>mihi, qua animum a gratitudine nequaquam alienum declarare <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>non ita tibi quam aliis etiam bonis viris possim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Diu <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>anxius de tua fui valetudine, quem tamen dei benignitate con<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>valuisse aliquantulum gaudio atque tibi nobisque omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>plurimum gratulor atque hoc praesertim tempore, quo ecclesia <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Christi novis indies hostibus insectatur paucique sint, qui <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>eorum crudelibus conatibus, qua deberent fortitudine spiritus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>resistant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod ad literas <persName ref="p8126">Oporini</persName> servo proximis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nundinis concreditas attinet, non est, quod te ipsum divexes.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName>Simon</persName> enim etsi ante transactum negocium diem ex im<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>proviso obierit, <persName ref="p8126">Oporinus</persName> tamen tui amantissimus probe omnia <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>s<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>e curasse ait, qui literas tuas in <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName> <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiae</placeName>, in <placeName ref="l832">Galli<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>am</placeName> autem <persName>Iacobo de Puteo</persName>,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName>Jacques Dupuys</persName>/Dupuis</note> bibliopolae <placeName ref="l378">Parisiensi</placeName>, curandas <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tradidit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Novarum rerum nihil adhuc certi habemus; audivim<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>us hisce diebus opidulum <placeName>Rimelsperg</placeName> in <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>confinibus situm a <persName ref="p8112">Francorum regis</persName> militibus nescio quibus inva<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sum atque direptum esse propter commeatum, quem hactenus <persName>Cesari</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>miserunt, expectamusque, quid praeterea exploratores nostri <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sint allaturi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, vir clarissime, et cura valetudinem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Raptim <placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 15. calendas februarii anno 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8406">Conradus Lycosthenes</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Die kriegßleut, so for <placeName ref="l322">Metz</placeName> gelegen, ziehen bey uns in grosser <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>zal durch, gar arbetselig, handt sich mit alten gauteren, stergen <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>und weiberpelzen bekleidet, so si geraubet und gestolen <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>haben, domitt si sich der kelte mochten erweren.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Deren sint etlich <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nit weit ob <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> durch die pauren mit pflegelen, darni<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>der geschlagen worden, denen si zuo <placeName>Mutentz</placeName> ein seiten <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>speck gestolen hatten etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Insigni pietate atque eruditione viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti vigilantis<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>simo atque amico incomparabili<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
